WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
Hi, I'm Fred Noseit, the keeper of AIEDUME, and your parent helper.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.300
Ask me anything and I'll find it for you, or send you to the right helper.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.870
Help your child learn with A.I.E. at home, safely, at any age.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:17.780
Tap any tile and I'll tell you what it is and how to use it.

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.470
Then tap go there, or ask me to help you make a lesson.
